What will be printed by the following code?
```java
try {
    throw new ArithmeticException("Custom Calc Error");
} catch (ArithmeticException e) {
    System.out.println(e.getMessage());
}
```

What happens if code appears directly after a `throw` statement in the same block without being inside an if-statement?
```java
throw new RuntimeException();
System.out.println("Hello");
```

